Added real-data guardrails around `process=compare_real` by blocking repo-root inputs by default (configurable via policy), and redacted input path fields in compare_real payloads so absolute paths do not land in metrics/logs. Updated docs and gitignore to codify the env-based real data root and “don’t put real data under repo” rules, and adjusted/added tests to validate the guardrail.

